
---

# 3. `.gitignore`

Create a file named `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Operating System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Windows
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# Temporary Files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
secrets/
credentials/
passwords/

# Packet Tracer temporary files
*.pkz
